# title: Averaging-in call
# category: Asians, lookbacks and ladders
# underlyings: 1
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: A call whose strike is the average of the first three monthly closes, so a bad entry day does not set the strike.
#
# Strike: average of the fixings on 2027-01-04, 2027-02-04 and 2027-03-04.
# Maturity 2028-01-04.

2027-01-04
    acc = spot()

2027-02-04  2027-03-04
    acc = acc + spot()

2028-01-04
    pays max(spot() - acc / 3, 0)
